===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:þis|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|þis}}, {{m|enm|this}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þis}} (neuter demonstrative), from the {{cog|gmw-nsg}} base {{m|gmw-pro||*þa-|that}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*þat}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*tód}}, extended form of demonstrative base {{m|ine-pro|*to-}}; + {{w|North-West Germanic}} definitive suffix {{m|gem-pro|*-s}}{{attn|gem-pro}}, from {{m+|ine-pro|*só||this, that}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|this||this}}, {{cog|stq|dusse||this}}, {{cog|fy|dizze||this}}, {{cog|de|dies}}, {{m|de|dieses||this}}, {{cog|gmq-ogt|þissi||this}}.

